Create a file named **`.gitignore`** in the root of your solution and paste this:

```
# Build output
bin/
obj/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Rider
.idea/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# Test results
TestResults/
*.trx

# NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# Logs
*.log

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
  
# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json

# User-specific ASP.NET settings
secrets.json

# Coverage
coverage/
coverage.xml

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Publish output
publish/
Publish/

# Azure / deployment
*.publishsettings

# Node (if frontend is added later)
node_modules/

# Local MongoDB data
data/
mongodb-data/

# Backup files
*.bak
*.backup
